# Code owners for Tashtit.
#
# Ownership here MUST stay in step with MAINTAINERS.md; every owned path maps to
# a maintainer or plugin owner listed there. The last matching pattern wins, so
# per-plugin owners below can refine the repository-wide default.
#
# Team handles resolve only once the corresponding GitHub team exists. Until an
# individual owner is designated, the maintainers team owns the path.

# Repository-wide default owner.
*                                   @tashtit/maintainers

# Governance, security, and release-critical files.
/GOVERNANCE.md                      @tashtit/maintainers
/MAINTAINERS.md                     @tashtit/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                        @tashtit/maintainers
/docs/                              @tashtit/maintainers
/scripts/                           @tashtit/maintainers
/.github/                           @tashtit/maintainers
/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json    @tashtit/maintainers

# Plugin owners.
/plugins/engineering-standards/     @tashtit/maintainers
/plugins/git-workflow/              @tashtit/maintainers
/plugins/github-actions-standards/  @tashtit/maintainers
/plugins/logging-standards/         @tashtit/maintainers
/plugins/repository-onboarding/     @tashtit/maintainers
